 "notes": "AxionPhoton (ALP-photon) limit from ALP-photon oscillation in blazar/Galactic magnetic fields; not a DM search so no density dependence. Headline result is the combined 95% C.L. excluded region (Fig. 5, shown as red Mrk 421 contour in Fig. 6). Curve extracted by vector-tracing the red-fill boundary in the e-print vector figure fig_compare_contour_421 (drawing 17), calibrated on axis decade ticks: x 1e-10 eV at px57.7, 67.3px/decade; y 1e-10 GeV^-1 at px22.9, 87.75px/decade. Points trace the lower boundary of the excluded region (the upper limit on g_agamma); the flat top of the red region at 6.6e-11 is the CAST cap, not a Mrk421 feature. Eq.1 Lagrangian L=-(1/4)g_agamma a F Ftilde matches canonical convention, no conversion. Text: limit within ~[2e-11,6e-11] GeV^-1 for ~5e-10 <= m_a <= 5e-7 eV.",
